name va-shadow-implicit
# A verb synset (BabelNet's key of it, read as the ILI concept), a role of its frame, and the synsets that fill the
# role as a shadow argument (VA_bn2shadow) or an implicit one (VA_bn2implicit), as the file's name says after its "2":
# the row says together that the synset has the role as such an argument, and what fills it. The fillers are written
# with | between them. The first line is the release's banner, not a row.
match VA_bn2shadow.tsv VA_bn2implicit.tsv

tier row by \n
skip 1
names synset role filler
tier field by \t
part filler by |

stem 2 .
thing row synset
type synset ili
type filler ili
content role
together row
relate row {file} to role
relate row role to filler
